  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Purpose SPEAR Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is expected to be implemented in  Dedza District reaching out to 35,000 households, 5 Cooperatives and 20 productive groups with 5,200 members established under ASPIRE and ACCESS; and transitioning to Mzimba and Nkhotakota Districts reaching out to 20,000 HHs under the Social Cash Transfer programme growing to 30,000 HHs through stove commercialisation approach. UP will partner Kadale Consultants, CUMO Microfinance, District authorities, local government structures, private sector, community leaders and other civil society organisations to implement the programme</narrative>
  </description>
